    "description": "Example OpenRouter model registry for the Nestor presets (v0.7.0 rosters + per-vendor fallback chains, references/presets.md). pal's built-in registry is frozen at Dec 2025 and knows none of these ids; without a registry pal assumes a 32K context window and drops most files from the packet (references/setup.md §1). Copy this file somewhere outside the plugin, point OPENROUTER_MODELS_CONFIG_PATH at it in the pal server env, and keep context_window / max_output_tokens in step with the vendor pages when you refresh a roster. Aliases are for ad-hoc pal chat calls; Nestor always passes full ids.",
